        +(1-f_A)\sigma_{\text{total}}A_{\text{total}}\,\Big] \\
&= \eta\,\kappa\,\sigma_{\text{total}}\,A_{\text{total}}\,
   \bigl[f_A+(1-f_A)\bigr] \\
&= \eta\,\kappa\,\sigma_{\text{total}}\,
   \frac{6\,m_{\text{beads}}}{\rho_{\text{glass}}\,d_{\text{bead}}}
   \;=\;
   \eta\,\kappa\,\sigma_{\text{total}}\,
   \frac{3\,m_{\text{beads}}}{\rho_{\text{glass}}\,r_{\text{bead}}}\; .
\end{aligned}
\]

Hence  

\[
