\frac{\sqrt{K_{\mathrm{O}_{2}}\,p_{\mathrm{O}_{2}}}}
      {1+K_{\mathrm{CO}}\,p_{\mathrm{CO}}+\sqrt{K_{\mathrm{O}_{2}}\,p_{\mathrm{O}_{2}}}}\,.
\end{aligned}}
\]

