-\left(\frac{\sigma_{ij}}{r_{ij}}\right)^{6}\right]
+\frac{q_{i}q_{j}}{4\pi\varepsilon_{0}r_{ij}}
\]

is the Lennard‑Jones + Coulomb ion–water term (with Lorentz‑Berthelot mixing). The sum over \(N\) incorporates the ion–water interaction energy through the exponential factor.

